# Explicit naming

- Prefer full words: `productId`, `nutritionalInfo`, `manualKkal` (domain term), `fileUrl`
- Avoid cryptic abbreviations in new identifiers (`req`, `res`, `repo` as type names)
- Mapper/file names must describe direction: `request-body-to-create-product-use-case-input`
